    lgo:text "(l) a reminder of the existence of the legal guarantee of conformity for goods and its main elements, including its minimum duration of two years as provided in Directive (EU) 2019/771, in a prominent manner, using the harmonised notice referred to in Article 22a of this Directive;"@en .

lg:EU-2011-83-art6-1-l-q1-de
    a lgo:Quote ;
